`directory[strlen(directory) + 1]` would be `directory[5]`, which is 'e'.
So `directory[strlen(directory) + 1] != '\0'` would be true, and it would return. This is correct.
If `filename` is `"secret\0.txt"`, `strlen(filename)` is 6.
